{# New drawing, from the toolbar's Draw button: the canvas size, asked for
   first, as a community's page asks (community.jinja). Outside the nav, so
   it is not boosted -- the painter is a page load of its own -- and so no
   ancestor of the bar's is the box `position: fixed` is measured against.

   The button stays a form of its own at 300 × 300, which is what a press
   does without script. With it, the press opens this instead
   (`oeeeDrawDialog`), as do the `new-drawing` command and its key.

   The script is frontend/site/drawDialog.ts. A boosted swap runs the line
   at the foot again, which wires the new dialog; the document listener is
   added once, and finds the dialog by id each time. #}
<div id="draw-dialog" class="ds-modal" style="display: none;" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="draw-dialog-title">
  <div class="ds-modal-panel">
    <h2 id="draw-dialog-title" tabindex="-1">{{ ftl_get_message("community-drawing-new") }}</h2>
    <form action="/draw" method="post">
      <div class="form-field community-draw-size">
        <label>
          <span class="ds-label">{{ ftl_get_message('community-drawing-width') }}</span>
          <select name="width" class="ds-select">
            {% for w in [300, 350, 400, 450, 500, 550, 600, 650, 700, 750, 800, 850, 900, 950, 1000, 1024] %}
              <option value="{{ w }}" {% if w == 300 %}selected{% endif %}>{{ w }}</option>
            {% endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
        <span class="community-draw-times" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
        <label>
          <span class="ds-label">{{ ftl_get_message('community-drawing-height') }}</span>
          <select name="height" class="ds-select">
            {% for h in [300, 350, 400, 450, 500, 550, 600, 650, 700, 750, 768, 800] %}
              <option value="{{ h }}" {% if h == 300 %}selected{% endif %}>{{ h }}</option>
            {% endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      {% include "draw_tool_field.jinja" %}
      <div class="form-actions community-draw-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ds-button" data-draw-dialog-cancel>{{ ftl_get_message("cancel") }}</button>
        <button type="submit" class="ds-button ds-button-primary">{{ ftl_get_message("community-drawing-new") }}</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
<script>if (window.oeeeChrome) window.oeeeChrome.drawDialog();</script>
